# Anthropic API key used ONLY by the /api/chat serverless function
# (the lead-qualifying chatbot). It is never exposed to the browser.
#
# Production: set this in the Vercel dashboard —
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables → ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#
# Local function testing: put the key in a gitignored .env and run `vercel dev`
# (plain `vite dev` does not serve /api — the widget falls back gracefully).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
